The ATS integrations were written against the vendors' documented public JSON
endpoints (Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby) and contain no third-party code.

autopilot-jobhunt (https://github.com/tarunlnmiit/autopilot-jobhunt, MIT) was
evaluated during design and informed the module layout, but no code or data from
it was used.

career-ops (https://github.com/career-ops-hq/career-ops, MIT) — the dedupe rules, the liveness classifier and the salary text rules are reimplemented from its ideas; no code copied verbatim.
